  "body": "I have an application here where it is crucial that I send a specifically timed serial break.\r\nIt would be great if you could add that somehow.\r\nIt would be preferable if you did this non-timed e.g. I set break to enabled, then I can choose how long using a timer, then disable the break again.\r\n\r\nThere are quite a few older devices that use this type of break as some sort of wake up command.\r\nThanks!",
